{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いよいよ明日10月13日(火)\n16枚目シングル「愛MUST BE」\nフラゲ日ですーーー☺️🚀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob734vJ8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobtXvddl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はやい方は明日からお手元に届くのかな！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わーーーーー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます。ありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🗓明日10月13日(火)19時57分から\nNHK「うたコン」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🗓14日(水)発売日💐20時から\n櫻坂46 OFFICIAL YouTube CHANNEL\n16th Single『愛MUST BE』リリースパーティー\n松田里奈、小田倉麗奈、谷口愛季、\n松本和子、山田桃実、田村保乃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🗓15日(木)19時から\nフジテレビ「STAR」2時間スペシャル"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🗓16日(金)21時から\nテレビ朝日「MUSIC STATION」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🗓17日(土)23時から\nNHK「Venue101」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🗓19日(月)19時から\nTBS「CDTVライブ！ライブ！」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出演させていただきます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に本当にありがとうございます！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん嬉しいね。嬉しい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "精一杯頑張ります！楽しみます！☺️♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここ最近も毎日メンバーとずっと一緒にいて、\n歌って、踊って、笑って、たまにネジが外れて、ヘトヘトになって、笑って、踊って、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんながいるから頑張れます！！☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "笑顔が沢山あって、\n日常の節々に幸せを感じる毎日をおくらせてもらっています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あたたかい気持ちをくれてありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうして発売を喜ぶことも、\nリリース期間をみんなと過ごすことも、\n本当に最後なんだなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだちょっとだけ不思議かな、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと足がフラフラになるまで踊ることも、\nみんなと頑張れる機会も、\nみんなと緊張することも、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "減っていっているんだなぁと思うと\nひとつひとつ尊くて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハーサルの時とか、\nみんなに余分に絡んでしまうもん！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ごめんね！！！！！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと必死になれる今を大切に大切に\n過ごしていきたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非、今シングルもBuddiesといっしょに\n盛り上げていきたいです！！🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんとうにいつもありがとうね‪＾‬ ‪＾‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、\n収録曲歌唱メンバーも発表されました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/news/detail/R00636?ima=0000"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16枚目シングルも\n楽しみにしていてください！！😌🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "がんばるぞーーーー🏋🏻‍♀️( ◜◡◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob2xn63q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobRMk6Xp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob4gfs2S.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリももう少ししたらはじまるね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆっくりお話しようね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesがだいすきだよー！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほなね！\n櫻坂46 田村保乃"}], "source": "official"}